#ASSERT `May I amend my statement of claim without leave` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `May I amend my statement of claim without leave` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `May I amend my statement of claim without leave` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `May I amend my statement of claim without leave` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
