#ASSERT `May I change the facts I rely on` TRUE `I discovered facts I did not know and could not reasonably have discovered before serving` EQUALS `yes: clause 30 authorises the change; notify the other parties as soon as practicable (cl 30(4))`
#ASSERT `May I change the facts I rely on` TRUE `another party changed the facts it relies on` EQUALS `yes: clause 30 authorises the change; notify the other parties as soon as practicable (cl 30(4))`
