-- cl 6, 7. Inputs: kind of fee, pro bono scheme, certified, concession card, community legal service, judgment.
#ASSERT `Is my fee postponed or waived` `the filing fee for my initiating process or cross-claim` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `no judgment yet` EQUALS `postponed until judgment is given (cl 6(1) or 7(1)); the registrar must not refuse to file your documents meanwhile`
-- Pro bono without the written certificate: not a pro bono party (cl 6(4)(b)).
#ASSERT `Is my fee postponed or waived` `the filing fee for my initiating process or cross-claim` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `no judgment yet` EQUALS `payable in the usual way when the document is filed or the service rendered (cl 10(1)), unless the registrar postpones, waives or remits it (cl 10(2))`
-- Pro bono covers only the filing fee; a pensioner's postponement covers any fee.
#ASSERT `Is my fee postponed or waived` `another fee in the proceedings` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE `no judgment yet` EQUALS `payable in the usual way when the document is filed or the service rendered (cl 10(1)), unless the registrar postpones, waives or remits it (cl 10(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my fee postponed or waived` `another fee in the proceedings` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `no judgment yet` EQUALS `postponed until judgment is given (cl 6(1) or 7(1)); the registrar must not refuse to file your documents meanwhile`
#ASSERT `Is my fee postponed or waived` `another fee in the proceedings` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `judgment against me` EQUALS `not to be taken at all, or remitted if it was taken (cl 6(2) or 7(2))`
#ASSERT `Is my fee postponed or waived` `another fee in the proceedings` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE `judgment for me, with neither costs nor more than nominal damages` EQUALS `not to be taken at all, or remitted if it was taken (cl 6(2) or 7(2))`
